# Admin Web (Goat OS)

Read **`apps/admin-web/AGENTS.md`**, `context/frontend/current-admin-web-scope.md`,
and **`mock/goatos-dashboard-mock.html`** before UI work.

## Non-negotiables

- **UI source of truth**: `mock/goatos-dashboard-mock.html` (structure/density,
  not just colors). Never reuse old admin UI primitives or cyan/slate palette.
- **Backend-owned contract**: nav, labels, filters, chips, drawer copy, empty
  states, and disabled reasons come from `GET /admin-web/bootstrap` — not React
  constants. Extend `backend/internal/adminui/app/service.go` + OpenAPI first.
- **Scope lock**: PHC Vaccination + Admin Config/SOP for current slice. No nested
  command-room routes under `/vaccination` or `/procurement`.
- **Gate before push**: `npm --prefix apps/admin-web run check:mock-fidelity`.

## Local dev

- `npm run dev:local` starts **Next.js only** (`:3300`). Backend on `:8080` must
  run separately or use `make dev-local` from repo root.
- Agents may restart `:3300`/`:8080` without asking; restore same ports afterward.
